<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n49129" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">θρησκ-εία</span></b> , 
			Ion.
		
		<b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">θρησκ-είη</span></b> , ἡ, (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">θρησκεύω</span>) <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>religious worship, cult, ritual</i>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἡ περὶ τὰ ἱρὰ θ</span>. <i><span class="en">
				Hdt.
				2.18
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>IG</u>
				12(5).141.5
			</span></i> (Paros, <span class="entity">iii B.C.</span>), <i><span class="en">
				J.
				<u>AJ</u>
				17.9.3
			</span></i>, etc.; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τοῦ Ἀπόλλωνος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>SIG</u>
					801
				</span></i>
			
			<u>D</u> (Delph., <span class="entity">i A.D.</span>); <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἡ περί τινος θ</span>. ib. <i><span class="en">
				867.48
			</span></i> (Ephesus, <span class="entity">ii A.D.</span>): pl., <i>rites</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Hdt.
				2.37
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				D.H.
				2.63
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>PGnom.</u>
				185
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(ii A.D.)</span>, Wilcken <i><span class="en">
				<u>Chr.</u>
				72
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(iii A.D.)</span>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>religion, service of God</i>, <i><span class="en">
				LXX
				<u>Wi.</u>
				14.18
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Act.Ap.</u>
				26.5
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Ep.Jac.</u>
				1.26
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">θ. τοῦ θεοῦ μία ἐστί, μὴ εἶναι
					κακόν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>Corp.Herm.</u>
					12
				</span></i>
			 fin.; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἑκατέρα θ</span>., i.e.
			Christianity and Paganism, <i><span class="en">
				Them.
				<u>Or.</u>
				5.69c
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">θ. τῶν ἀγγέλων</span>
			<i>worshipping</i> of angels, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Ep.Col.</u>
				2.18
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b> in bad sense,
				<i>religious formalism</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀντὶ ὁσιότητος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ph.
					1.195
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">θ. βιωτική</span> vulgar
				<i>superstition</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Sor.
				1.4
			</span></i>.</div>
